8	/**
9	 * Validates the submitted postcode against the owner's city region, but only WHEN
10	 * PRESENT: an absent postcode is left untouched so an owner created without one is still
11	 * accepted (the request contract stays backward-compatible). The 4-digit format is
12	 * enforced by the DTO {@code @Pattern}; this step adds the range rule via
13	 * {@link OwnerPostcodes}, rejecting an out-of-range postcode with 400 through
14	 * {@link InvalidPostcodeException}.
